Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:45.78,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,DOPPELLUSION
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:49.39,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,BATU SIHIR [ELEMEN SUCI]
